Workflow provenance
===================

Files under workflows/ are adapted from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, which is
MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2023-present Comfy Org. That notice is retained
here as MIT requires, and workflows/LICENSE carries the full text.

Every workflow declares its origin in the recipe that ships it, under
`workflows[].derived_from` as {repo, commit, template}. `tools/lint_catalog.py`
requires that field to be present and non-null on every workflow, or to be
explicitly `null` for a graph hand-authored from scratch.

No workflow here is CC0. An MIT derivative cannot be released into the public
domain without stripping the notice MIT obliges us to keep.

